OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with some sunny spells into the
OL,7,Fevening. Clouding over through the
OL,8,Fnight with some mist and low cloud
OL,9,Fpossible. Patchy rain developing
OL,10,Ftowards dawn. Mild with fresh to
OL,11,Fstrong winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy with patchy, mostly
OL,14,Flight, rain. The rain clears to the
OL,15,Feast around midday to leave a partly
OL,16,Fcloudy and dry afternoon. Warm in the
OL,17,Fsunshine and easing winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
