OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FLargely dry and sunny on Thursday,
OL,7,Fclouding over later. Breezy with
OL,8,Fisolated showers on Friday. Dry and
OL,9,Fmostly cloudy on Saturday.
OL,10,FTemperatures around average.
